OL,3,GNEWSATravellers leave site after High
OL,4,ACourt injunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravellers who set up an unauthorised
OL,7,Fcamp on green belt land have now moved
OL,8,Foff the site after a High Court
OL,9,Finjunction.
OL,11,FThey had been given a deadline of 24
OL,12,FAugust to leave Friendless Lane in
OL,13,FFlamstead, Hertfordshire.
OL,15,FIn July, deputy high court judge
OL,16,FChristopher Kennedy ruled in favour of
OL,17,FDacorum Borough Council after it took
OL,18,Flegal action in a bid to clear the
OL,19,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
