OL,3,GNEWSATravellers leave site after High
OL,4,ACourt injunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FBilly Pither, chairman of Flamstead
OL,7,FParish Council, said: "They have been
OL,8,Fleaving steadily over the last week and
OL,9,Fwe had drone footage of the very last
OL,10,Fcaravan leaving, so there's a couple of
OL,11,Fvehicles and a container left but no
OL,12,Foccupants."
